{ title: "nested checked target"
  doc: "Fixture for `test_tester_reports_nested_checked_target`: the `inner`
  target carries a failing `RESULT` inside `test-outer`, which passes on
  its own `RESULT`. The inner check does not decide the outer verdict, so
  the tester must report `inner` as never running and fail the file
  (eu-oaz72.69)." }

` { target: :test-outer }
outer: {
  ` { target: :inner }
  inner: { RESULT: :FAIL }
  RESULT: :PASS
}
